Cell["\<\
Next gives conceptual meaning to the Voigt matrix that until now was just a 6 \
x 6 array. 
Remember the elastic map Lbold[c] comes from the Aki & Richardson expression \
for stress as a function of strain. \
\>", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.784485966855825*^9, 3.7844860394164658`*^9}, {
   3.784486274471085*^9, 3.7844862754085846`*^9}, {3.7844900486130314`*^9, 
