Cell["\<\
ProjToVSigOFvpt is only for \[CapitalSigma] = MONO and \[CapitalSigma]=XISO. \
The point vpt must be on the unit sphere.\
\>", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.99721638859511*^9, 3.9972164270921593`*^9}, {
  3.9972170444107866`*^9, 
