8c4e067dbd66"],

Cell["\<\
You can define custom variants by (no underline, no semicolon-equal).\
\>", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.91458237511664*^9, 3.914582464032797*^9}, {
  3.9145825014424725`*^9, 3.9145825195713696`*^9}, {3.917540772338996*^9, 
