Cell["\<\
Looking for relation between \[Delta]T[Tmat, MONO] and \[Delta]T[Tmat, ISO].  \
Delete eventually .\
\>", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9271564787164288`*^9, 3.927156554730872*^9}, {
  3.979557142396316*^9, 
